  "body": "Beautiful sea views, an affordable $799,000 price tag with a vendor who's ready to meet the market. Opportunities like this don't come around every day. \r\n\r\nIf you've been dreaming of coastal living without the premium price tag, don't let this one pass you by. The owner has bought and seriously committed to selling. All written offers are welcome. Other agents - bring your buyers.\r\n\r\nOffering approximately 106 sqm of well-designed living space, this impressive property features 3 generous double bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms and spacious open-plan living, making it an ideal choice for families, first-home buyers or those looking for a low-maintenance modern home in the coast.\r\n\r\n* 3 spacious double bedrooms, including a well-appointed master suite\r\n* 2.5 modern bathrooms, with a stylish ensuite and convenient ground-floor guest toilet\r\n* Spacious open-plan living and dining, designed for everyday living and entertaining\r\n* Premium modern kitchen with a contemporary layout and quality finishes\r\n* Excellent indoor-outdoor flow opening onto a private timber deck\r\n* Beautiful bush outlook with sparkling sea views, providing a peaceful backdrop to your daily life\r\n* Heat pump for year-round comfort\r\n* Freehold title, no Body Corp fee\r\n* Balance of 10-Year Master Build Guarantee for added peace of mind\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned in popular Orewa, this home is close to local schools, early childhood centre, parks, walking trails and the beautiful Orewa Beach. With easy motorway access, commuting to Auckland and surrounding areas is convenient, too.\r\n\r\nCome and experience the views and lifestyle for yourself. Contact Tim 021 055 2650 today to arrange your private viewing or visit our open home.",
